SUMMARY:[Hike - Intermediate] 10Km Fast Pace Fitness  Hike- Heber Down - W
 hitby
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nHeber Down Conservation!\n\nThis is a **fa
 st-paced** intermediate hike based on speed (**Going between 4.5-5km/hr**)
  with few stops. The beginning will be flat with the paved sections\, and 
 we will be going into the back trails\, where there will be mud if it rain
 ed the night before. We will cover about 10km in 2 hours\, **with minimal 
 breaks**.\n\n**Not a beginner hike!**\n\n**THIS HIKE STARTS AT 9:05am**\n\
 nBring a water bottle and dress for the weather.\n\nParts of the trail can
  get muddy if it rains the night before. Be prepared.\n\nWe are going to m
 eet at the Old Cullen Gardens parking lot.\nIntersection Cochrane & Taunto
 n.\n\nGo to the back of the parking lot near the new Pickleball courts. Th
 e path starts to the left of the picnic shelter.\n\n**Hike leaves promptly
  at 9:05am**\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP
 'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that yo
 u have read\, understand and accept the following:\n\n1. **GTA Hiking Meet
 up is a private group**. Attending events is voluntary by you as a member.
  Participation in any activity with us is at your own risk.\n2. By joining
  this event as a member you agree to indemnify and hold harmless its organ
 izers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, event hosts\, and other mem
 bers from all claims or liability of every type (including court costs and
  legal fees) for injury or death to any person or for damage to property\,
  loss of personal property or any other wrongful act arising out of or rel
 ating to your participation as a member. This agreement applies to you and
  to other persons (as your guests) who may accompany you in these endeavor
 s.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizers as well as other group member
 s harmless. By participating voluntarily in the group\, you expressly waiv
 e any and all such claims against each and every other member in the group
 \, including without limitation any and all claims against the group organ
 izer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, and event hosts.
